# Pet Mode design inputs, deliberately not versioned. The archives are the single source
# of truth for their contents -- nothing is extracted into the tree, so there is never a
# second stale copy to reconcile. PET_MODE_V2_SPEC.md is the exception: it has no archive,
# so it is the only copy that exists.
